WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.433 --> 00:00:04.984
Unit twenty-five. AI Makes Mistakes Too!

2
00:00:05.907 --> 00:00:10.669
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Emily, your technology teacher.

3
00:00:10.719 --> 00:00:14.421
Hi, Ms. Emily! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:14.471 --> 00:00:18.717
Today we learn about AI Makes Mistakes Too. Let's go!

5
00:00:19.873 --> 00:00:24.296
AI. Say it with me. AI!

6
00:00:27.765 --> 00:00:31.619
Mistake. Say it with me. Mistake!

7
00:00:35.086 --> 00:00:38.708
Check. Say it with me. Check!

8
00:00:42.259 --> 00:00:46.252
Answer. Say it with me. Answer!

9
00:00:49.767 --> 00:00:54.000
Source. Say it with me. Source!

10
00:00:57.487 --> 00:01:01.017
Human. Say it with me. Human!

11
00:01:04.506 --> 00:01:08.255
Wrong. Say it with me. Wrong!

12
00:01:11.751 --> 00:01:15.296
Think. Say it with me. Think!

13
00:01:18.809 --> 00:01:31.538
AI tools are helpful, but they can give a wrong answer and sound very sure. I check important answers with another source or a human expert. I always think for myself.

14
00:01:31.588 --> 00:01:35.017
Now I understand. Thank you, Ms. Emily!

15
00:01:35.701 --> 00:01:41.280
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:41.330 --> 00:01:42.480
Check!

17
00:01:43.380 --> 00:01:48.882
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:48.932 --> 00:01:50.082
Wrong!

19
00:01:50.935 --> 00:01:58.956
Did you know? AI chatbots can sometimes make up facts that sound real — so checking is important!

20
00:01:59.006 --> 00:02:01.632
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:02:02.316 --> 00:02:12.286
Think and answer. How can you check if an AI answer is correct?

22
00:02:12.336 --> 00:02:13.770
Great answer!

23
00:02:14.540 --> 00:02:23.875
Congratulations, everyone! You finished Technology Grade 4. Keep exploring technology safely. Goodbye!

24
00:02:23.925 --> 00:02:27.698
Thank you, Ms. Emily! See you in Grade 5!

